          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: PARIS (75) 23.08.2015 T1 Temoin 5photos.7z Questionnaire terre-R.pdf PARIS (75) 24.08.2015 T1 Temoin 3photos.7z Questionnaire terre-R.pdf",
          "text_sha256": "d44f314731f745213ac2b07dce668b12e4c5730e80de9f30fcf1d1f3bf7906db"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
